              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŵalanjilane ni mundu juŵamsumilejo yaka yisigalile kuti cikwanile caka cakusangalalila yaka 50. Mtengo wakuliwombolela kwakwe uŵe wakulandana ni winji wa yaka yisigalileyo. Nipo alipile mwakamlipilile mundu jwamasengo pa ndaŵi jelejo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwenela kuwusya mbiya siŵamsumile sya yaka yisigalile kuti cikwanile caka ca 50. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.51+LEV.25.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.51",
              "LEV.25.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa ndaŵi jakutama ni ambujegwe, akwenela kumsunga kapolojo mpela mundu jwamasengo. Ambujegwewo akamsunga mwa ngalwe, m'mwejo mli mkulola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naga ngakuwomboledwa mwa matala gelega, taciwomboledwa pa caka ca 50, jwalakwe pamo ni ŵanace ŵakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
