          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu Isalaeli ngakwenela kutama kapolo kwa yaka yosope, ligongo ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ali acikapolo ŵa AMBUJE. Ŵakopwesye mcilambo ca Iguputo, Ali AMBUJE Mlungu ŵawo.",
          "type": "text",
